              <p class="talk-description">Enterprise AI assistants do not stay inside the model. They connect to email, documents, customer systems, knowledge bases, and tools, then assemble context across boundaries that traditional inventories rarely capture. Vivek gives leaders a five-question method for finding these hidden data-access and accountability risks before a deployment scales. The session replaces abstract warnings with a concrete operating view of permissions, retrieval, aggregation, logging, and control ownership.</p>
